flowchart TD

A[Business Event]

A --> B[Create Job]

B --> C[BullMQ Queue]

C --> D[Worker Picks Job]

D --> E{Successful?}

E -- Yes --> F[Update Database]

F --> G[Send Notification]

G --> H[Complete Job]

H --> End([Done])

E -- No --> Retry{Retries Remaining?}

Retry -- Yes --> C

Retry -- No --> Failed[Move to Failed Queue]

Failed --> Alert[Create Alert]

Alert --> End